<title>UK: Cypriot, Turkish ships in collision off Spain.</title>
<headline>Cypriot, Turkish ships in collision off Spain.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cypriot-flag bulk carrier Theodoros S. and the Turkish registered Gulsum Ana were in collision 30 miles off Malaga, Spain, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 27,023 dwt Theodoros S., with a cargo of sugar, was holed and is being towed to Cadiz for repairs.</p>
<p>The 33,423 dwt Gulsum Ana is slightly damaged and has made its own way to Malaga.</p>
</text>
